<description>&lt;p&gt;Colombian forces continued targeting ELN guerrillas, killing ten fighters in Cauca and another ten in a separate operation, while President De la Espriella confirmed the death of two ELN leaders. Former Cucuta security chief Castellanos was shot dead, and the United States will deploy over 300 military personnel for two weeks of joint exercises along the Venezuelan frontier, reflecting heightened security cooperation. The government also faced internal challenges, including reports of PHP security flaws on official websites and a high-profile drug and firearms trafficking case involving a Colombian man in the United States. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNVXVoN2lBLW1KSmVzUnlOMno1TXBOZ29mcUE1RjRMTktLYVNoalZjSDFCRy1uaXVTSHN4ZWNxNFQxTmNYTU5mV0haZmpkc2ZOdDMxYXpSWXJqY2ZRaGNVUFFYcVpPT19YSEFxaWhKZ0NQTTB0MU5NM0tiSTBONDNOcjdJamZtX3Z0SEtBWXZQd2hOYnhiMW5KWUFrR1U0ajJnTjV0bHdUSnYyWTlGMktz?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KTLA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPVHRwSjNiUm95NUZfczYzeVcxY0hRMmlPZ1RkRHBETjJYQmJZWk5aRVpoSVUyTWtaY09CcGRkYVlqMmoxU2ZIdzQtQ1JKXzU5QmhQSnJDMWVsbTBKLTY0QjZLNjB6WENiakU2Tkx5VGtYaVIwMlNuZGtKVHBhcWRXaUdtS3gtaVhpRFBQTUFrZUR4ZENyMnF1cVVScnlqWEl1STR0YTdKQUdvMWJkejVOMXctSWJXdUNx?oc=5&quot;&gt;CBS News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxQNG5TdjU4d1Y5Q2p3M0QyMXNaLThWWW5UaHItTHp0UjdiVmg5NHVsUUgxdUZtQjZNaXo1Q2VfZ2hFQ0xfaGE2RkxvRlEyZFRGd3lxQUhUOXRGenF2WC1TOTR1THZxVGlzdU1sc2M5N